 Wei and father of Wen Yang, who rose to Lt. Governor of Yang Province. Dissatisfied with the Sima family's treatment of Cao Fang after they took power, he joined Guanqiu Jian in raising a rebellion, which failed. He then defected to Eastern Wu. Shortly after, when the Wei general Zhuge Dan sought to bring his forces to Wu, Wen Qin was ordered to rendezvous with him alongside other Wu generals. However, due to a disagreement while defending the city, he was killed by Zhuge Dan.","jp":"魏の武将で文鴦の父。官職は揚州刺史に至る。司馬家族が政権を握ると曹芳への処遇に不満を抱き、毌丘倹らとともに挙兵して謀反を起こすが失敗し、東呉へと身を寄せた。その後まもなく魏将の諸葛誕が兵を率いて呉への帰順を試みた際、文欽は命を受けて呉の諸将とともに救援に向かったが、城を死守する中で諸葛誕と意見が対立し、諸葛誕に殺害された。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 문앙의 아버지로, 관직은 양주자사에 이르렀습니다. 사마 가문이 집권한 뒤 조방에 대한 처우에 불만을 품고 관구검 등과 함께 거병하여 반역을 꾀했으나 실패하자 동오에 투항했습니다. 얼마 후 위나라 장수 제갈탄이 군사를 이끌고 오나라에 귀순하려 하자, 문흠은 명을 받고 여러 오나라 장수들과 함께 호응하러 갔으나 성을 지키는 과정에서 제갈탄과 의견이 맞지 않아 결국 제갈탄에게 살해당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10435","remark":"","surname":"文","surnameTc":"文","surnameEn":"Wen","surnameJp":"文","surnameKr":"문","surnameOther":"","name":"钦","nameTc":"欽","nameEn":"Qin","nameJp":"欽","nameKr":"흠","nameOther":"","word":"仲若","wordTc":"仲若","wordEn":"Zhongruo","wordJp":"仲若","wordKr":"중약","wordOther":"","icon":"文钦","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"74","force":"83","wise":"43","politics":"34","charm":"57","will":"83","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"24/24/81/24/24/10/50/24","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1010105;1003702","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012405","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint":"6800","debateSoulPoint":"1800","strategy